  "title": "Cookies in a Jar (Emergency Cookies)",
  "description": "This oatmeal cookie mix, with cranberries and chocolate chips, makes a thoughtful and inexpensive Christmas gift for your friends and family. Be sure to include directions on how to bake them!",
